From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jaydens-tasty-slop
 <325336397+jaydens-tasty-slop@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:28:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/mdp5: don't wait for PP_DONE on a disabled
 command-mode CRTC

msm_atomic_commit_tail() waits for the previous frame of every CRTC in
the commit before it starts, and for the new one at the end. On a
command-mode CRTC that is a wait for PP_DONE, which only comes for a
frame that was sent. Two waits run on a CRTC that sends none:

- the commit that disables the CRTC still flushes it
  (drm_atomic_helper_commit_planes() is called without
  DRM_PLANE_COMMIT_ACTIVE_ONLY and the CRTC state keeps its CTL), which
  re-arms the completion, and the wait at the end of that commit times
  out;
- the next commit, which enables the CRTC again, waits for it at its
  start.

Each costs the 50 ms timeout and logs "pp done time out". On an SM-T820
(bonded command-mode DSI) every blank and unblank logged it once, and
the first modeset after boot too. Skip the wait while the CRTC is
disabled.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c | 15 ++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c
index 3f318c270e..e40f01b955 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/mdp5/mdp5_crtc.c
@@ -1383,12 +1383,21 @@ struct mdp5_pipeline *mdp5_crtc_get_pipeline(struct drm_crtc *crtc)
 
 void mdp5_crtc_wait_for_commit_done(struct drm_crtc *crtc)
 {
+	struct mdp5_crtc *mdp5_crtc = to_mdp5_crtc(crtc);
 	struct mdp5_crtc_state *mdp5_cstate = to_mdp5_crtc_state(crtc->state);
 
-	if (mdp5_cstate->cmd_mode)
-		mdp5_crtc_wait_for_pp_done(crtc);
-	else
+	if (mdp5_cstate->cmd_mode) {
+		/*
+		 * A disabled CRTC has no frame in flight. Its completion
+		 * can be pending all the same: the commit that disables it
+		 * still flushes it, and the first enable waits before any
+		 * frame was sent.
+		 */
+		if (mdp5_crtc->enabled)
+			mdp5_crtc_wait_for_pp_done(crtc);
+	} else {
 		mdp5_crtc_wait_for_flush_done(crtc);
+	}
 }
 
 /* initialize crtc */
